    "text": "Let G = A ∗H B be the generalized free product of groups A and B with\namalgamated subgroup H.\n    a) Conjecture: If both A and B are nilpotent, then µ(G) ⩽ H.\n   b) Conjecture: If G is residually finite, and H satisfies a nontrivial identical rela-\ntion, then λ(G) ⩽ H.                                                      M. K. Azarian",
